{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:55 2026-06-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:55 2026-06-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:55 2026-06-03 HKT</p><p>游達榮馬房的「首駿」，早前在田草千二米贏馬，其後上場轉戰谷草一千米跑第四後，今晚繼續在谷戰岀擊，結果在千二米力壓「金風萬里」，以十倍冷門險勝，贏得今季第二場頭馬。</p><p>賽後練馬師游達榮說:「『首駿』今場排四檔有利，牠在五班常常跑近，演出尚算準繩。雖然牠跑沙田和快活谷都合適，但我覺得牠出爭快活谷比較好，希望今季再出仍然繼續交出好成績。」</p><p>值得一提，奧爾民上季至今曾九度策騎游廄馬，但未嘗入過三甲，今戰騎練第十次合作，騎者終憑「首駿」替游達榮建功取得頭馬。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0f62cae85e2fa9f24dfb966b09ceadaf/2026-06/1a0c77b5-1438-4ca3-aa9b-c935b7be166a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aa257d1cf301c5334c733ed9baf2d16e/2026-06/1bb7fee2-a650-4597-95c8-0fd9dd7cdc0a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6508ebf2d410fb075142d0f113baa0bf/2026-06/1bd5d278-c7dc-4376-bdc3-74ab0efe786e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4bf18443440e39415333456504e62b46/2026-06/5ae256d8-b8b0-4173-ae1c-06de064cbd4e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff520c1d3cafaf2580fdac3f9d24e551/2026-06/5c3f36b5-3bc0-469b-baeb-a78ea1b8a3de.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f90b37e082030442b0c6e980530d1ff2/2026-06/7faf51f7-3687-4f3b-877c-140836a2e255.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5d0d8b306a7d0a07e481b09efcae215c/2026-06/8da324f8-e9c5-4304-bcfd-54bc8b87cf85.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b7e66344d162f26c53dc0de18d7c6cd4/2026-06/59d06840-f4eb-4719-b23c-5048d9bf5eac.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d7ad9a04588a0010b70b933d7bcbfe0d/2026-06/68da1236-f67c-4fc1-a405-572a9b71acaa.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e61cd97776fb9de5828dc94cf233a856/2026-06/200d751c-44b1-4387-bbf7-da79ba847723.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5a1da480e8ab62a3791318325ffc5d25/2026-06/7757c121-dc38-44ea-9f4f-3b8fe3a7f00f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3dcec83ba0c8213f5172d